# Portal Invariants

Nuxt 4 auth-first portal. Details: `docs/operational/ARCHITECTURE.md`, `docs/operational/E2E-TESTIDS.md`, `.cursor/skills/portal-base/`.

## 4 tầng (bắt buộc)

`pages/components` → `composables` → `services` + `stores` → `models` + `validations` → `$apiFetch`

- **Không** gọi `$apiFetch` trong page/component
- **Không** import ngược: `models/` → stores/services/composables
- Form: `useApiForm` + `validations/` + `models/` (contract)
- Contract naming: `portal-contract-naming.mdc`

## Thêm feature (thứ tự)

`models/` → `services/` → `stores` (optional) → `composables/` → `validations/` → `pages/` + `testId`

## UI tiers

`components/ui/` (shadcn) → `molecules/` (`Mo*`) → `organisms/` (`Data*`, `OrGlobal*`)

Dashboard dùng shadcn admin primitives trong `layouts/dashboard.vue`; không thêm `layouts/themes/*` hoặc theme switcher.

- **UI vocabulary / gen:** `shared/portal-design.registry.json` — shadcn canonical, `#shell: DataListPage` cho list. Rule: `portal-design-vocabulary.mdc`. Promotion: `docs/operational/DESIGN-REGISTRY-PROMOTION.md`.

## Kích thước (ngưỡng mềm)

File ~**200** dòng · function ~**20** dòng — vượt thì tách. Chi tiết: `portal-code-size.mdc` (glob).

## E2E

Playwright (`tests/e2e/`). Gắn `data-testid` trước spec. `page.getByTestId()`.

## Import alias

Hand-written app code: `@/`, `~/`, `#...` — không relative `../` / `./`. Chi tiết: `portal-import-alias.mdc` (glob).
